#: data/json/items/book/chemistry.json
msgid ""
"This book describes cold petroleum cracking - a type of process that occurs "
"below the freezing point, compared the common process that occurs at nearly "
"400 centigrade.  You can't really use this type of process without a lot of "
"additional equipment, but the book provides plenty of information about "
"common methods that you can do by hand."
msgstr ""
