#. ~ Description of variant "A Guide To Making Yourself A Hard Target" of item
#. "Treasury of Legends about Western Dancing"
#: data/json/items/book/dodge.json
msgid ""
"Written by self-defense instructor Neal Martin, this book describe techniques"
" and movesets you need to train to avoid being a victim, as well as avoid "
"trouble with the law in the aftermath."
msgstr ""
"Napisana przez instruktora samoobrony Neala Martina książka opisuje techniki "
"i zestawy ruchów, które musisz wytrenować, by nie stać się ofiarą, a także by"
" uniknąć potem kłopotów z prawem."

